<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 23/24.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 23/24.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>23/24. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 23/24    April 22/23</p>
<p> CZK	0.45022	 0.45165</p>
<p> DKK	2.09989	 2.10023</p>
<p> FIM	2.65158	 2.64735</p>
<p> HUF	0.07597	 0.07588</p>
<p> JPY	0.10877	 0.1083</p>
<p> LTL	3.42879	 3.41888</p>
<p> LVL     23.57493	23.47051</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	 0.00238</p>
<p> SEK	1.7869	  1.7877</p>
<p> UAH	7.4319	  7.41647</p>
<p> USD     13.71	   13.6704</p>
<p> XEU     15.59855	15.60134</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
